(7721022, 1270493, 30861, '<td valign="top">Of the top finishers, far and away the most interesting in my eyes. The others are nice shots but right down through the top 10 we''ve seen them all before in various iterations, a common enough situation at DPC where entries often seem to be prototyped against previously successful work. THIS image, however. is different, and more than that it''s daringly different, because where the "subject" is specifically "blur" you gave us at least 75% blown-out sky and let the dancers do their minimalistic tree impersonations on the perimeters :-)<br/> <br/>I was one of the 10s. Well done!</td>', 'Of the top finishers, far and away the most interesting in my eyes. The others are nice shots but right down through the top 10 we''ve seen them all before in various iterations, a common enough situation at DPC where entries often seem to be prototyped against previously successful work. THIS image, however. is different, and more than that it''s daringly different, because where the "subject" is specifically "blur" you gave us at least 75% blown-out sky and let the dancers do their minimalistic tree impersonations on the perimeters :-) I was one of the 10s. Well done!', '2022-05-31 23:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
